      "amount": "1",
      "notes": "used as a vessel"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 375°f (190°c).",
    "in a copper mug, whisk together ground sugar, ferment-kimchi, eggs, buttermilk, unsalted butter, salt-free seasoning blend, and baking powder until smooth.",
    "place the mug in the oven and bake for 25 minutes.",
    "after 25 minutes, carefully remove the mug from the oven and let it cool for 5 minutes.",
    "run a knife around the edges of the mug to loosen the bake, then invert onto a plate.",
    "serve warm, garnished with additional ferment-kimchi if desired.",
    "let the bake cool completely before refrigerating or freezing for later use."
  ],
